  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.0: Performance and reliability improvements. HTTP/3: single WriteAsync per response (was 4), ArrayPool in ReadVariableIntAsync, fast-path empty body on GET. WebSocket: zero heap allocations on echo hot path — persistent ArrayBufferWriter, header-only TryParseHeader, SIMD ApplyMask, deferred batch flush; pipe buffers 4KB→64KB. Static files: Brotli serving via pre-generated .br sidecar files; gzip sidecar preference over runtime compression; proper AcceptsEncoding word-boundary matching. Memory: socket send buffer 256KB→32KB (saves ~1GiB at 4096 connections); JSON thread-local buffer 1MB→64KB initial. Fixes: chunked upload deadlock (pipe pause threshold 1MiB→32MiB); exception logging now gated behind debug mode in production.",
